**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Scan Type**: perf_optimizer\n- **Generated**: 1/30/2026, 1:34:42 AM\n\n## Description\nReportShell, ThemedSidebar use framer-motion AnimatePresence and motion.div for simple opacity/scale transitions. Replace with CSS transitions and React.Transition for these basic animations to reduce JS animation overhead and bundle size.\n\n## Reasoning\nFramer Motion is powerful but heavyweight (~45KB). For simple fade/scale animations, CSS transitions are more performant and dont require JS per-frame calculations. Reduces bundle and improves animation smoothness.\n\n## Context\n\n**Note**: This section provides supporting architectural documentation and is NOT a hard requirement. Use it as guidance to understand existing code structure and maintain consistency.\n\n### Context: Report Shell & Navigation\n\n**Description**: Main report container with themed sidebar, toolbar, and navigation. Provides the structural layout and controls for viewing research reports.\n**Related Files**:\n- `src/components/report/ReportShell.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportView.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportSidebar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ThemedSidebar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/ReportToolbar.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/index.tsx`\n- `src/components/layout/ReportModal.tsx`\n\n**Post-Implementation**: After completing this requirement, evaluate if the context description or file paths need updates. Use the appropriate API/DB query to update the context if architectural changes were made.\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\nUse Claude Code skills as appropriate for implementation guidance. Check `.claude/skills/` directory for available skills.\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an AI-evaluated project idea. No specific goal is associated with this idea.\n\n## AFTER IMPLEMENTATION\n\n1. Log your implementation using the `log_implementation` MCP tool with:\n   - requirementName: the requirement filename (without .md)\n   - title: 2-6 word summar